{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39867","headline":"喜雨上主人尚书 · 徐夤","name":"喜雨上主人尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天皇攘袂勅神龙，雨我公田兆岁丰。\n几日淋漓侵暮角，数宵滂沛彻晨钟。\n细如春雾笼平野，猛似秋风击古松。\n门下十年耕稼者，坐来偏忆翠微峰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39867.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39867","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}